flowchart LR
    Setup([uv sync]) -.-> Code
    Code[write code] -->|save| IDE[pyright in IDE]
    IDE --> Code
    Code -->|git commit| PC[pre-commit hook]
    PC --> Ruff[ruff check + format]
    PC --> Pytest[pytest]
    Ruff --> Check{all green?}
    Pytest --> Check
    Check -->|pass| Commit[commit created]
    Check -->|fail| Fix[fix]
    Fix --> Code
